                "name": "eventId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "form-urlencoded",
              "data": []
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates a webinar.\n\n- **liveDuration** parameter conditions:\n  - When copying a webinar, users are able to provide a liveDuration value in 15 minute increments (e.g. 15, 30, 45, 60, etc.) up to 120 minutes.\n  - Above 120 minutes, increments will be 30 minutes up to 480 minutes.\n  - The maximum allowed liveDuration is 480 minutes.\n- **liveStart** accepted date/time formats:\n  - **MM/DD/YYYY hh:mm a** (08/26/2016 09:00 AM)\n  - **YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss** Default timezone will be Pacific Time. (2016-08"
        },
