            "body": {
              "type": "form-urlencoded",
              "data": []
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates an Email Notification for a particular event.\n\n- **fromLabel** validations:\n  - Only alphanumeric characters and a maximum of 50 characters are allowed.\n  - International characters or email addresses are not allowed.\n- **whentosend** accepted values:\n  - 2 Weeks Before Event\n  - 1 Week Before Event\n  - 5 Days Before Event\n  - Days Before Event\n  - 2 Days Before Event\n  - 1 Day Before Event\n  - 12 Hours Before Event\n  - 6 Hours Before Event\n  - 5 Hours Before Event\n  - 4 Hours Before Eve"
        },
